{"segs": ["PA_ja_92:0.2", "PA_ja_92:0.3"], "en": "Ekakanipāta, Littavagga (The Chapter on the Small)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_92:0.4"], "en": "2. The Mahāsāra Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_92:1.1", "PA_ja_92:1.2"], "en": "“In Ukkaṭṭha they desire a hero, but among counselors, one free from curiosity.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_92:1.3"], "en": "\"Delight in food and drink,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_92:1.4"], "en": "and when the opportunity arises, act wisely\"—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_92:2.1"], "en": "thus ends the second Jātaka, the Mahāsāra-jātaka.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"}
